000D82r 2               @loop_done:
000D82r 2                     ; Resume past THIS REPEAT's ] BEFORE restoring outer state — restore pops
000D82r 2                     ; body_resume back to the enclosing REPEAT's value, so reading it after the
000D82r 2                     ; restore would resume at the wrong token (trailing commands never run).
