000EAAr 2               ; do_if — IF condition [body]
000EAAr 2               ;   Arity 0 — handles its own argument parsing
000EAAr 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
000EAAr 2               do_if:
000EAAr 2  20 rr rr           JSR   eval_expr
000EADr 2  B0 1D              BCS   @err
