001424r 2               ; do_readlist — READLIST: read a line, return as a list
001424r 2               ;   Arity 0, no arguments. Reporter.
001424r 2               ;   Calls read_line, tokenize_line, then walks tokens building a list.
001424r 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
